<title>GERMANY: Gerling life unit 95 premiums up 7.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Gerling life unit 95 premiums up 7.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1995</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   13	vs 24.5</p>
<p>    Gross profit				 796.5   vs 766.4</p>
<p>    Allocation to reserves for payouts   608.2   vs 741.9</p>
<p>    Premium income			    2,781.7  vs 2,590.1</p>
<p>    New premium income			 632.4   vs 583.4</p>
<p>    Payouts to claimants		    3,556.6  vs 3,266.2</p>
<p>    Sums insured			    66,192.0   vs 62,841.0</p>
<p>    Capital investments		    22,049    vs 20,699</p>
<p>    Dividend				     20	vs 20 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German insurer is Gerling Konzern Lebensversicherungs AG, which groups the life insurance activities of the Gerling group.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
